{
"t": "the poem",
"m": "15 lines · ᑕᐣᓯ",
"body": "I am Gill\nI am James\nI am an artist\na Cree voice rising\nweaving sound into the unseen\nIndigenous kin, my culture’s pulse\nvisual arts\nFine art and music\nare rivers I swim, a daily drift\na lifelong hum\nArtistry a starfield I chase\nAll my relations,\nin all my creations\ntheir breath in every chord I make and everything\nI create."
}
